-- הסכם אופק חדש (25.12.2008), §62: parts יג–יט apply also to the head of a
-- regional support centre, of a therapeutic centre and of a teachers'
-- centre; not to the head of a Pais cluster, who is employed as a
-- junior-high first deputy (§89) at the complexity level of §66(ט).

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `base-agreement-common`
§ `62`

DECLARE `head of an institution` IS ONE OF
    `a school principal`
    `the head of a regional support centre`
    `the head of a therapeutic centre`
    `the head of a teachers' centre`
    `the head of a Pais cluster`

DECLARE `terms of a head` IS ONE OF `the principals' parts יג–יט`, `a junior-high first deputy's terms under §89`

@ref akn:art_62
GIVEN h IS A `head of an institution`
GIVETH A `terms of a head`
DECIDE `the terms the head is employed on` h IS
    IF h EQUALS `the head of a Pais cluster` THEN `a junior-high first deputy's terms under §89` ELSE `the principals' parts יג–יט`

#ASSERT `the terms the head is employed on` `the head of a therapeutic centre` EQUALS `the principals' parts יג–יט`
#ASSERT `the terms the head is employed on` `the head of a Pais cluster` EQUALS `a junior-high first deputy's terms under §89`
